ce: <a href="https://bestoftwitter.substack.com/p/best-of-twitter-may-2025-12">Best of Twitter - May 2025 (1/2)</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/yishan/status/1926245782799143311</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/yishan/status/1926245782799143311</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 04:29:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sebastian Caliri (@SebastianCaliri) on X]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Gr1whw5WwAAWTz-.jpg:large"></p><p>Sebastian Caliri (@SebastianCaliri) on X</p><p>Use of prescription stimulants like Vyvanse, Adderall, and Ritalin is exploding for working age adults. Fill volume ~tripled from 2012 to 2023, to over 37M. I don’t think we properly understand the downstream consequences of having ~4-5% of the US labor force on stimulants.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/SebastianCaliri/status/1926824122098606194">https://x.com/SebastianCaliri/status/1926824122098606194</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://bestoftwitter.substack.com/p/best-of-twitter-may-2025-12">Best of Twitter - May 2025 (1/2)</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/SebastianCaliri/status/1926824122098606194</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/SebastianCaliri/status/1926824122098606194</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 04:29:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ryan Moulton (@moultano) on X]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1429993324643983369/2dp6R1a4_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Ryan Moulton (@moultano) on X</p><p>Makes me wonder if Bush’s primary personal failing was actually idealism.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/moultano/status/1927024334918267223">https://x.com/moultano/status/1927024334918267223</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://bestoftwitter.substack.com/p/best-of-twitter-may-2025-12">Best of Twitter - May 2025 (1/2)</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/moultano/status/1927024334918267223</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/moultano/status/1927024334918267223</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 04:29:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Crémieux (@cremieuxrecueil) on X]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Gr0uyWbXMAAM8rL.jpg:large"></p><p>Crémieux (@cremieuxrecueil) on X</p><p>The revolution in organ transplants is here thanks to gene editing. A 62-year-old man on dialysis needed a new kidney. Doctors implanted him with a pig’s kidney that had been given 69 edits to be human-compatible. He immediately stopped needing dialysis.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/cremieuxrecueil/status/1926751272620707965">https://x.com/cremieuxrecueil/status/1926751272620707965</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://bestoftwitter.substack.com/p/best-of-twitter-may-2025-12">Best of Twitter - May 2025 (1/2)</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/cremieuxrecueil/status/1926751272620707965</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/cremieuxrecueil/status/1926751272620707965</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 04:29:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Matthew Zeitlin (@MattZeitlin) on X]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Gql_HNAW0AAfLeh.png:large"></p><p>Matthew Zeitlin (@MattZeitlin) on X</p><p>i always wondered why Spain was neutral during WWII despite its ideological closeness to Germany, turns out FDR held up two oil tankers in Houston and they basically folded immediately (The Economic Weapon, Nicholas Mulder)</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/MattZeitlin/status/1921206748012044336">https://x.com/MattZeitlin/status/1921206748012044336</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://bestoftwitter.substack.com/p/best-of-twitter-may-2025-12">Best of Twitter - May 2025 (1/2)</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/MattZeitlin/status/1921206748012044336</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/MattZeitlin/status/1921206748012044336</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 04:29:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Higher Ed Reform: Focus on Acade